{"availability":"available","full":"Omarion9000/global-football-2026-predictor","name":"global-football-2026-predictor","description":"Independent football analytics dashboard for the 2026 international tournament, featuring probabilistic match predictions, simulation, scheduler logic, and a polished portfolio UI.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-11T01:22:46Z","updated":"2026-06-20T18:31:49Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://global-football-2026-predictor.vercel.app/","topics":["monte-carlo","nextjs","poisson","portfolio-project","react","sports-analytics","statistics","supabase","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://global-football-2026-predictor.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:27.920Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:27.920Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:27.920Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:27.920Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An independent football probability dashboard for the 2026 international tournament — built end-to-end in TypeScript as a portfolio project.","A deterministic statistical engine (Dixon-Coles with confederation-strength correction, seeded Monte Carlo simulation over the 48-team bracket) produces title probabilities, group-stage advancement, and a knockout tree that a Next.js App Router UI surfaces as three broadcast-pastel views — available in English and Spanish via an instant in-page toggle. Engine, scheduler, persistence, and UI are isolated by lint boundaries and verified by 690+ tests.","v0.1 milestone. The offline tournament simulator + public-facing simulator UI are feature-complete (Phases 9A–9D). The simulator reads a manually-edited results file and emits a committed JSON contract that the UI consumes; live data integration is a separate future phase."],"features":["Deterministic prediction engine. Same input plus same seed produces byte-identical output. All randomness flows through one seeded RNG; Math.random() is never called from inside the engine.","Append-only prediction history. Every scheduled run inserts a new row; earlier runs are preserved forever. A SQL unique constraint plus a TypeScript PredictionRepository interface with no update methods enforce the rule…","Idempotent scheduler retries. The scheduler computes scheduledfor as the canonical lifecycle timestamp (kickoff − 3 h, etc.), so Vercel Cron retries collapse onto the same row via the unique idempotency key.","Engine isolation, enforced. src/components/ is forbidden from importing @/lib/model, @/lib/simulation, @/lib/normalization, @/lib/utils/rng, or @/lib/utils/poisson. The boundary is enforced by ESLint and a runtime…","Mock-first development. Eight fictional teams, four group-stage fixtures, realistic stats. Real provider integration is deferred until a documented datasources row exists per the asset policy."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Omarion9000/global-football-2026-predictor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"91cf59efaa0cea0ef8e34ef5171a9f4b5c8706ed922905cacdde9bdec925aad4","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:28.021Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:28.021Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An independent football probability dashboard for the 2026 international tournament — built end-to-end in TypeScript as a portfolio project.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Omarion9000/global-football-2026-predictor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"91cf59efaa0cea0ef8e34ef5171a9f4b5c8706ed922905cacdde9bdec925aad4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Omarion9000/global-football-2026-predictor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:28.022Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-20T18:31:49Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Omarion9000/global-football-2026-predictor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-